"""Keeps track of which functions of Blitz3D and BlitzPlus the test suite has to cover.

  suite_functions.py list     Reads the original sources in /third_party and writes tests/suite/functions.txt.
  suite_functions.py pending  Writes a placeholder test for every function that is not implemented yet.
  suite_functions.py check    Fails if a function has no test, or a placeholder test is for something that exists now.

functions.txt has one function per line: name, module, state (done or pending) and the signature the original
registers it with. A function is done once it is in code_compiler/source/builtins.inc, or the compiler handles it.
Done functions have to be named by at least one test in tests/suite. Pending functions have a file of their own in
tests/suite/pending, which is expected to fail to compile until the function exists.
"""
